# Which letter is in no US state's name?
subtitle: "J, Q, X or Z: one letter appears in no US state name. Pick it, then meet the lone states that save the other three."

## Which letter is in no US state's name?
affirm: playful
text: {"font_size":34}

    box t_J "J" x 140 y 540 width 210 height 210 font_size 140 hidden true
    box t_Q "Q" x 380 y 540 width 210 height 210 font_size 140 hidden true
    box t_X "X" x 620 y 540 width 210 height 210 font_size 140 hidden true
    box t_Z "Z" x 860 y 540 width 210 height 210 font_size 140 hidden true
    text s_J "New Jersey" #2f6b8f x 140 y 395 font_size 34 hidden true
    text s_Z "Arizona" #2f6b8f x 860 y 395 font_size 34 hidden true
    text s_X1 "Texas" #2f6b8f x 620 y 395 font_size 34 hidden true
    text s_X2 "New Mexico" #2f6b8f x 620 y 335 font_size 34 hidden true
    text s_Q "none!" #b5482e x 380 y 395 font_size 40 hidden true
    text abq "Albuquerque" #8f887c x 430 y 225 font_size 48 hidden true
    text qc "Quebec" #8f887c x 500 y 225 font_size 48 hidden true
    text abq2 "2 Qs" #b5482e x 720 y 225 font_size 48 hidden true

    card title "Which letter is in no state?"

Fifty US states, from Alabama to Wyoming. One of these four letters appears in none of their names.
    draw t_J t_Q t_X t_Z

All four are rare letters in English. But only one is missing completely.
    highlight t_J t_Q t_X t_Z

    ask "Which letter appears in no US state name? Tap it." choose ["t_J","t_Q","t_X","t_Z"] answer t_Q
        right: Q. Not one of the fifty states has a Q in its name.
        wrong: Try spelling the states with the most unusual names.

J is rescued by a single state: New Jersey.
    draw s_J

Z also hangs on by one: Arizona.
    draw s_Z

X does a little better, with Texas and New Mexico.
    draw s_X1 s_X2

But Q has nobody at all.
    draw s_Q

The nearest miss is a cit (@draw abq abq2@)y: Albuquerque, in New Mexico, which has two Qs of its own.

    erase abq abq2

For a Q, you have to c (@draw qc@)ross the border, to the Canadian province of Quebec.

So Q is the only letter of the alphabet that no state name uses.
    highlight t_Q
